  "provenance": "All six arms measure the #671 round-2 firmware: the shipping writer's boot judges each slot on one staged read under a three-read bound and holds the writer when a slot's authority is unknown, and the console names the hold only when the writer is held; nvm_capture() and the census of #629 are unchanged. Processor pin 2ad2f845. The six arms ran from the tree of 49d28e5a, two at a time. The capture SoC has no Milan MAC MDIO CSR, so the PHY path is compiled out. ARM through ATTEST contains no heartbeat or PHY call.",
